1. Clone GitHub:

git clone https://github.com/jonahmr1/lenix_42A7A4.base.git
cd lenix_42A7A4.base

2. Restore the VPS backup into that cloned folder.
3. Configure the restored local exclude file:

git config --local core.excludesFile "%CD%\.local-git-exclude"

4. Recreate the three links if the backup didn’t preserve them:

mklink /D resources\lenix ..\lenix
mklink /D resources\ox_core ..\ox_core
mklink /D resources\ox_lib ..\ox_lib

5. Verify:

git status